flowchart TD
  baseline[Dependency decision and Ansari baseline] --> server[Prepare MCP delivery migration]
  baseline --> view[Prepare core and Lit migration]
  destination[Verify destination layout and MIT obligations] --> candidate[One destination transplant candidate]
  server --> candidate
  view --> candidate
  sdk[Complete SDK quality and packaging checks] --> npm[Public SAGA source and npm packages]
  candidate --> checks["Clean install, regressions<br/>resource compatibility and rollback"]
  npm --> checks
